 Q3","e":"sxt","d":"2018-10-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen J. Rolfs","x":"These non-GAAP financial measures remove the impact of restructuring costs, currency movements, the impact of the 2017 US tax legislation and other items as noted in the Company's filings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/19/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q3-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2018 Q3","e":"sxt","d":"2018-10-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"The results were impacted as expected by lower volumes due to restructuring fallout at one of our plants in North America, along with higher onion costs and continued pricing pressure for onion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/19/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q3-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2018 Q4","e":"sxt","d":"2019-02-15","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"So the Synthetic Food Colors business where we draw many of our raw materials from Asia not affected by the tariff so much as they are affected by regulatory changes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/15/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q4-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2018 Q4","e":"sxt","d":"2019-02-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Garo Norian","x":"What is it specifically that kind of causes the delay in passing through?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/15/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q4-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2018 Q4","e":"sxt","d":"2019-02-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen J. Rolfs","x":"These non-GAAP financial measures remove the impact of restructuring costs, currency movements, the impact of the 2017 US tax legislation, depreciation and amortization, non-cash stock-based compensation and other items as noted in the Company's filings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/15/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q4-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2018 Q4","e":"sxt","d":"2019-02-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"During that call, we indicated that the significant headwinds we faced in Flavors & Fragrances, of onion pricing and cost, and the restructuring fallout would be behind us in the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/15/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q4-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2019 Q3","e":"sxt","d":"2019-10-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"The impact of tariffs has resulted in higher costs for certain raw materials from China and is caused other suppliers to raise their prices as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/18/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q3-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2019 Q3","e":"sxt","d":"2019-10-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"In most situations, it has been difficult to pass on the full impact of the tariffs through pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/18/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q3-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2019 Q3","e":"sxt","d":"2019-10-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"Coming out of restructuring, we built our inventory to improve our customer service commitments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/18/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q3-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2019 Q3","e":"sxt","d":"2019-10-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"We have also reduced our capital expenditures consistent with our smaller post restructuring production footprint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/18/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q3-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2019 Q4","e":"sxt","d":"2020-02-14","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"We saw uncertainty in higher costs tied to raw material availability tariffs and trade disputes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/14/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q4-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2019 Q4","e":"sxt","d":"2020-02-14","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Stephen J. Rolfs","x":"So, going back to 2019, you had not only the tariffs, but you also had some regulatory actions that happened earlier in China, that made it difficult to get certain raw materials.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/14/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q4-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2019 Q4","e":"sxt","d":"2020-02-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"And so, I think that that is one of the factors that kind of hit us a little bit in Q4, because there is a lag between when you get costs and when you can take price at times.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/14/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q4-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2019 Q4","e":"sxt","d":"2020-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"Furthermore, the fixed cost takeout actions we implemented in cosmetics throughout 2019 will help us to deliver improved profits as the year progresses and as sales continues to grow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/14/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q4-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2019 Q4","e":"sxt","d":"2020-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"…quarter in all three of our groups, we will have some hangover in our profit performance during the first quarter as a result of the impacts from the inventory reduction in 2019, product mix in cosmetics and the time necessary for our fixed cost takeout actions to realize their full run rate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/14/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q4-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2020 Q1","e":"sxt","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"As I outlined in our last call, we expected our profit to be down in the first quarter, as a result of the impacts from the inventory reduction efforts in 2019, product mix in cosmetics, higher raw material costs in natural ingredients and the timing of our fixed cost takeout actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2020 Q1","e":"sxt","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"As noted in our last call, we expected our profit to be down in the first quarter as a result of the impact of our significant inventory reduction in 2019, higher raw material costs, particularly in onion, and as our cost takeout plans materialize.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2020 Q2","e":"sxt","d":"2020-07-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"The Group's revenue growth is based on strong new wins generated throughout 2019 and the first part of 2020, retaining existing business, and an overall decline in attrition which was a lingering effect from our earlier restructuring activities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/17/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q2-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SXT 2020 Q3","e":"sxt","d":"2020-10-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"Additionally, the group's focus on transitioning the product portfolio to more value-added solutions and the reduction of its production cost structure from restructuring and ongoing initiatives is complementing the revenue growth and the overall improvement in the group's profit and margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/16/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SXT 2020 Q3","e":"sxt","d":"2020-10-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"I think the profit improvement plan as we look at that for some folks who may be newer to the Sensient story, they'll note that we did have a series of restructuring events over the last number of years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/16/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SXT 2020 Q4","e":"sxt","d":"2021-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Heidi Vesterinen","x":"What is your outlook on raw material costs and price increase?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/12/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q4-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SXT 2020 Q4","e":"sxt","d":"2021-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"The cost reduction initiatives from our earlier restructuring efforts along with our ongoing fixed cost takeout initiatives have also contributed to the overall profit and margin improvement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/12/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q4-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SXT 2020 Q4","e":"sxt","d":"2021-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"You know, the restructuring is many, many years gone now, I think that we are well past those impacts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/12/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q4-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SXT 2021 Q1","e":"sxt","d":"2021-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"What we saw last year was not necessarily raising prices so much as is elimination of discounts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/23/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q1-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SXT 2021 Q1","e":"sxt","d":"2021-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"The group's operating profit and profit margin improvement is a direct result of the strong sales growth, product mix shifts, and our ongoing fixed cost takeout initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/23/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q1-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SXT 2021 Q1","e":"sxt","d":"2021-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"So it has become more and more of a fixture in this organization over the years really stemming from our experience with restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/23/sensient-technologies-corp-sxt-q1-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SXT 2021 Q3","e":"sxt","d":"2021-10-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Green","x":"In terms of price increases, I think you alluded to the fact you were going to maybe give us some detail in Q4.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/15/sensient-technologies-corporation-sxt-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SXT 2021 Q3","e":"sxt","d":"2021-10-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Green","x":"Any more detail at this stage in terms of what kind of magnitude of price increases?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/15/sensient-technologies-corporation-sxt-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SXT 2021 Q3","e":"sxt","d":"2021-10-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"And so they are, what we have been focused on, we went through a very painful restructuring process, we sold some pieces off and so what we have today, the food, flavors and colors, the SNI business, the bio-nutrients, our personal care.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/15/sensient-technologies-corporation-sxt-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SXT 2025 Q2","e":"sxt","d":"2025-07-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"As I mentioned on our last call, the current trade and tariff landscape has introduced additional complexity and certainty to our businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/sensient-sxt-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SXT 2025 Q2","e":"sxt","d":"2025-07-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"The situation continues to fluctuate, and based on current information, we expect the annual impact of tariffs to be slightly less than the $10 million we communicated previously.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/sensient-sxt-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SXT 2025 Q2","e":"sxt","d":"2025-07-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"We originally communicated a mid to high single-digit local currency adjusted EBITDA growth expectation, but we are now raising our guidance to high single-digit local currency adjusted EBITDA growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/sensient-sxt-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SXT 2025 Q3","e":"sxt","d":"2025-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"Also, as I mentioned during our last several calls, the current trade and tariff landscape introduced additional complexity and uncertainty to our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/31/sensient-sxt-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SXT 2025 Q3","e":"sxt","d":"2025-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"While we have already taken price to offset the impacts of the initial wave of tariffs and will continue to take these pricing actions into next year, we have witnessed some demand and volume disruptions in some areas of our business due to this uncertainty, particularly in Asia Pacific.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/31/sensient-sxt-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SXT 2025 Q4","e":"sxt","d":"2026-02-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"While some tariff-induced customer supply chain disruptions","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/13/sensient-sxt-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SXT 2025 Q4","e":"sxt","d":"2026-02-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ghansham Panjabi","x":"In the fourth quarter, local currency revenue was down 1.9% and local currency operating profit was flat primarily due to supply chain disruptions caused by significant tariff activities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/13/sensient-sxt-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SXT 2026 Q1","e":"sxt","d":"2026-04-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"First quarter had no shortage of newsworthy developments in trade, tariffs, and geopolitics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/24/sensient-sxt-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SXT 2026 Q1","e":"sxt","d":"2026-04-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"And in addition to that, we didn't see as much of that tariff distortions that I was sort of concerned about on the last call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/24/sensient-sxt-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SXT 2026 Q1","e":"sxt","d":"2026-04-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"…factors, but I think we can address this, and we will address this with a modest amount of price increase that we would expect to give principally focused in synthetic colors for food and personal care, but also anything related to logistics, which is effectively all in down and outbound…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/24/sensient-sxt-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SXT 2026 Q1","e":"sxt","d":"2026-04-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"So EPS -- so yes, we raised our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/24/sensient-sxt-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SXT 2026 Q3","e":"sxt","d":"2026-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"As tariffs come along and as other constraints in trade come along, this production has been shifting all over the world.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/sensient-sxt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SXT 2026 Q3","e":"sxt","d":"2026-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"There's a lot of shifting of these supply chains, principally in response to tariffs and these other sort of geopolitical factors you're reading about.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/sensient-sxt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SXT 2026 Q3","e":"sxt","d":"2026-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Manning","x":"I think we have done pretty well on raising the guidance and hitting the figures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/sensient-sxt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SXT 2026 Q3","e":"sxt","d":"2026-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Tobin Tornehl","x":"Reiterating our 2026 guidance, we continue to expect our local currency revenue to be up high single to low double digits, and our local currency adjusted EBITDA and EPS to grow at mid- to high-teen growth rates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/sensient-sxt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,4794,0,0,0,4285,254],[36,1,6777,0,0,0,6141,319],[39,1,5158,0,0,0,4332,593],[40,1,9371,0,0,0,7937,1114],[41,1,8000,0,0,0,7068,654],[42,1,5228,0,0,0,4350,642],[43,1,6234,0,0,0,5235,701],[44,1,7591,0,0,0,6382,872],[45,1,7200,0,0,0,5334,927],[46,1,6675,0,0,0,5754,631],[47,1,6668,0,0,0,5895,451],[62,1,8577,0,0,0,7303,1048],[63,1,6635,0,0,0,5692,709],[64,1,7406,0,0,0,6796,347],[65,1,7549,0,0,0,4919,2450],[67,1,7521,0,0,0,4898,2234]],"cinema":[[35,1,4794,0,0,0,4285,254],[36,1,6777,0,0,0,6141,319],[39,1,5158,0,0,0,4332,593],[40,1,9371,0,0,0,7937,1114],[41,1,8000,0,0,0,7068,654],[42,1,5228,0,0,0,4350,642],[43,1,6234,0,0,0,5235,701],[44,1,7591,0,0,0,6382,872],[45,1,7200,0,0,0,5334,927],[46,1,6675,0,0,0,5754,631],[47,1,6668,0,0,0,5895,451],[62,1,8577,0,0,0,7303,1048],[63,1,6635,0,0,0,5692,709],[64,1,7406,0,0,0,6796,347],[65,1,7549,0,0,0,4919,2450],[67,1,7521,0,0,0,4898,2234]],"imax":[[3